{"articleNo":"96195","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=96195&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014년 상반기(12기) TaLK 내국인장학생 선발 안내 (아포초등학교)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.12.06","hit":"3300","attachments":[{"name":"3.지원서 및 학습지도안 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=96195&attachNo=73178"},{"name":"2.모집 선발 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=96195&attachNo=73226"},{"name":"1. 모집 선발 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=96195&attachNo=73255"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">아포초등학교에서는 2014년 상반기(12기) 정부초청해외영어봉사장학생(TaLK) 내국인장학생을 모집·선발하고자 하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\">공 고 문</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1. 모집 영역 및 인원 : 12기 TaLK 내국인장학생 1명</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. 근무 조건</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 활동 기간 : 2014. 3. 1. ？ 2014. 7. 31.(5개월)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 본인이 희망하고 특별한 문제가 없을 경우 6개월씩 최장 2년까지 연장 가능(최우수 평가자에 한해 예외적으로 2년 추가 연장)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 강의 시간 및 강사료</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1) 강의 시간 : 주 9시간</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2) 강사료 : 시간당 14,000원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. 지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 지역에 대한 사랑과 봉사정신이 투철한 자</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 신체 및 정신이 건강한 자</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 국내 대학 재학생(휴학생 포함), 졸업생</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 교육대학, 사범대학/교직이수자(영어 전공자) 우대</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 영어로 의사소통이 가능한 자(영어 성적 제출 필) </span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">마. 평점평균이 3.2/4.5 이상인 자</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">바. TaLK 오리엔테에션에 참여할 수 있는 자(일정 추후 통보)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4. 지원서 접수</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 접수기간: ‘13. 12. 05(목) ~ 12. 13(금) ※ 학교 도착분에 한함</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 접 수 처: 아포초등학교 교무실(☎ 054-431-5009)</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 접수방법: 개별접수, 학교와 사전 전화 문의 후 우편접수 가능</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 구비서류</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지원서 1부(사진 첨부, 자기건강보고서, 자기소개서, 활동계획서)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2) 학습지도안 1부</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 첨부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">서식으로 작성, 초등학교 방과후학교 지도용으로 작성, 주제 및 내용은 초등학생의 수준 고려)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3) 봉인 추천서 1부 : 학과장, 지도교수 또는 소속 학과 교수 추천 </span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 추천인 연락처 및 서명 등재</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4) 봉인 성적증명서 1부</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 졸업자의 경우 졸업증명서 추가 제출 </span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">5) 공인 어학능력시험 성적(제출 필) 1부</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 취득일자 및 성적기준 점수 상관없이 토익, 텝스, 토플, IELTs 중 택 1이상 반드시 제출</span></p><p class=\"본문\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\"></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><spa